module

public import CFSG.Quasithin.ChapterH.Section13To16.CocodeLocal.Defs

/-!
# Native cocode calculations for H.15

This module currently exports the genuine weight-two M24 and M23 orbits,
their pair/point stabilizer descriptions, the M23 stabilizer isomorphism
with M22, and geometric definitions of the octad, sextet and trio spaces.
The compatible standard partitions give containment of the sextet pair
space in the trio pair space.

The M24 stabilizer isomorphism with Aut(M22), commutator and perfect-residual
actions, local dimensions, full action identifications, involution ranks
and remaining clauses of H.15.2–3, H.15.6 and H.15.8 are still obligations.
In particular the geometric containment alone is not a completed H.15.8.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
H.15, printed pp.398–402.
-/
